WEBVTT

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:22.390
Thank you for honoring
Abel's passing, General Marshall.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.100
Not at all. He was one of the
few people I consider a friend.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.730
I feel as though
I've done him wrong.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.900
Ingrid...

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:37.610
This is just between us...
but I'm a little jealous of Abel.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.750
Huh?

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:46.290
He fulfilled all his wishes
with that final mission.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.750
His life was given
for something.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.920
His wishes?

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:56.630
Ingrid, Kei, Yui, and Rena...
You're all safe now.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:01.810
This is exactly what he wanted.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.140
I'm sure he'd say he
doesn't need a headstone,

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:09.480
but I think it's fair that we have
something to remind us of him.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:11.730
Yes.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.610
Thank you.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.340
What are you doing? Come in.

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:02.390
O-Okay.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.520
This is the Empress' room?

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.810
I thought it'd be a bit bigger...

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:12.690
If you leave Yui alone,
she does everything by herself,

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.440
so she says this size is just right.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:17.570
Here.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:27.700
I'm sorry... but do you have
anything a bit more reserved?

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.920
Sure. Hang on a second.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.040
Wait, Rena.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.250
Kei?

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:37.090
Ingrid, sit over there!

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.960
Huh, what?

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.760
Okay.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:48.100
I've been thinking.
You've finally settled down,

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:51.350
so you should be more honest
and tell us how you're feeling!

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:52.940
It's not that simple...

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:56.270
You're a girl, aren't you?
You should feel free to think more

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.980
about what makes you happy!

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:02.650
You're right. I'll try to
think about that more now.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.360
Thanks, Kei.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:08.870
All right. You really have
to think about it, okay?

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:16.790
Does this mean that the
Regalia are no longer a threat?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.960
I believe so.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:22.550
What about the data
provided by Princess Ingrid?

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:26.090
It was a research report from
the Kingdom of Rimgarde.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:29.890
It details how the Fall of
Rimgarde came about.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:34.600
It's all very hard to believe,
even after having seen the Regalia.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:41.310
Ingrid has fought for the
past 12 years. I think it's true.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:46.030
She has stated that she'll accept
any judgment passed down.

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:51.580
We've got to think about
what's next. That included.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:56.870
But what exactly was Johann after?

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:04.720
Whatever the case, until we come
up with a plan, we'll have to have

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:08.720
Ingrid remain here.
Just as you wish, Yui.

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:12.770
It looks like Yui has been thinking
about how to take care of her.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:13.890
Really?

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:17.060
I suppose we'll leave it up to
you, then, if you don't mind.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.030
Okay!

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.830
I'm tired!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.790
I'm hungry!

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.210
What are you talking about?

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.250
You ate all of our food
as soon as you got back!

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:41.630
Aww...

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:46.130
Come on! She's watching!

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.510
But we worked really hard...

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:52.300
It was hot, then cold; we fell out
of the sky. It was really tough!

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:55.730
--Eep!
--Eep!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:59.150
Whatever. If you don't finish quickly,
you won't be able to go to Yui's castle!

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:02.190
--Aah! No way!
--No Way!

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:10.660
All right, let's do this!

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:45.400
Wow, you look really cute, Ingrid!
It looks great on you!

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:50.030
No, I just felt like trying it
on really quick, that's all!

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:52.820
You're already thinking about it, Ingrid!

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.040
No, really!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.790
You've got a good sense of style.

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:02.500
I-I'm going to change now.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:05.920
But you were finally being
honest with yourself.

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:11.010
Come on, Kei.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.470
Oh, yeah, so...

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:20.890
Do you mind if things
get a little more lively?

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:22.100
Huh?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:28.310
W-W-Who...
Who is this angel?!

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.030
Yui, is this Kei?!

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:32.280
U-Um, yes.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:38.070
God, I'm so sorry I never
believed in you before. I do now!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.410
--Wee!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:41.500
Hey, no running!

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.170
--Okay!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:48.580
Oh, my, this little lady is quite--
no, extremely beautiful, too!

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:53.760
So, this is my good friend--

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:56.470
Narumi Retsu! I'd love to
get to know you better!

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:59.020
And this is Her Royal Highness, Ingrid.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:02.560
Highness? So you're a princess?! I'm so sorry!

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:06.190
It's okay, I'm not a princess anymore.
You can forget about all the titles.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.020
Really? So we can get to
know each other better?!

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:11.690
Uh, um, sure...

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:15.490
--Yay! Thank you so much!
--R-Retty...

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:16.490
Retsu!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.160
We need your help!

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:21.870
Oh, okay! I'll see you later!

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.250
Hey, you're running!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.420
Running!

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.590
Oh, I am. Sorry 'bout that!
Okay, let's get to it!

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.170
--Okay!

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.630
You've got some nice friends.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.550
I sure do!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.930
--Cheers!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.090
Do you mind if I join you?

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:24.640
Rena and I really like this spot.

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:25.690
Yeah?

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.020
When we're feeling down or
dealing with something difficult,

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.070
one of us is sure to be sitting out here.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:35.490
We don't really talk about anything,
but just taking in the view

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.700
and sitting here quietly
seems to calm us down.

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:42.120
This place brings
back memories for me.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.290
Huh?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.660
It was during your mother's
enthronement ceremony.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:50.330
I was supposed to deliver
a celebratory speech...

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:55.170
But I ran out of the
building right before it.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:56.510
What?

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:01.100
I couldn't have cared less about
kings and princesses back then.

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:05.930
But when the ceremony started,
I suddenly got frightened.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:10.350
And I wasn't sure how to act if I went back.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:11.560
That's when...

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.610
Found you!

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:14.820
Oh...

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:23.200
My mom...?

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.660
She was holding you.
You were still pretty small.

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:29.290
Really? I'm sorry, I don't remember.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:34.000
You were probably still too young to
form memories, so it's no surprise.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.550
What are they doing?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:37.800
Eep!

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:38.720
Rena!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:40.470
If you're going to watch, keep quiet.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:41.680
'Kay.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:47.970
Um, what about the ceremony?
Is it okay for the Empress to leave?

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:51.350
"The new Empress suddenly
fell ill and took her leave

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:53.190
partway through the ceremony."

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:54.190
Huh?

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.780
"The ceremony could not
be continued and visiting

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:59.900
dignitaries' speeches
were cancelled."

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:01.570
Is that okay?!

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:05.490
Margaret and the others will
find a way to handle it. Right?

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:13.630
Wow, look at you!

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:15.840
Excuse me, Your Highness...

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:21.340
Um, so... why do we have kings?

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:24.260
That's what you were thinking?

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.140
It's an embarrassing memory now.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:35.560
Hmm... I guess it doesn't really
matter whether or not we have a king.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:37.150
Huh?

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:40.150
Do you like your country, Ingrid?

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:42.820
Yeah, I guess so.

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:44.910
What do you like about it?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:49.620
I just kind of... like it.
I'm sorry, it's hard to express.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:54.460
I just kind of like my country, too.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:57.880
It's all kind of fuzzy and hard to pin down.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:58.750
Yeah.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.840
I'd bet most people feel that way.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:01.880
Huh?

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:05.760
I just mean that you're probably
not the only one that feels

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:08.600
a bit down, like they don't
really know their own country.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:12.810
Don't worry about it!

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:16.770
But things that remind you how you
"just kind of like" your country,

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:19.980
or things that make you think
it's actually pretty nice...

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:23.820
Don't you think it's good to have them?

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:26.410
Yes... I do.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.950
Right? I think a king can be
another one of the things

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.750
that give people those feelings.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.590
I don't know if I can be that for them.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:43.760
I don't know if I can, either.

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:47.390
I get confused and upset sometimes, too.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:50.810
But in the end, I really do love Enastoria...

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.430
And I want to cherish that feeling...

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:59.390
That's why I'm going to do my best.
I'm sort of an Empress-in-training!

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:01.730
I wish I could think that way, too.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:06.200
Don't worry! You understand
how I feel now, don't you?

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.370
Y-Yes.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:10.950
Even if you or I can't do it,
we've got Yui.

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:13.750
And you and Yui will
have children, too.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:18.210
If someone can take our feelings
now and someday, somewhere,

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:22.130
become that kind of person,
then that would be enough.

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.340
Take our feelings...

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:28.300
I guess we'll both be in training, together!
We can help each other out!

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.140
Okay.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.230
Me, too!

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.350
That's right! You're in training, too!

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:03.880
You look like you have a question.

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:06.090
What about Rena?

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:10.800
It was after the Fall of Rimgarde
that I found out she was in Enastoria.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:16.720
Abel and I were waiting for you to
become bound to her ever since then.

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:19.520
Why me?

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:24.230
We thought it was destiny that your
mother took Rena into your family.

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:29.730
And when your parents passed,
you were the only one left at Rena's side.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:36.120
But when Johann found out where Rena was,
Abel and I ran out of time.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:41.130
That's why you came after
her with the Regalia Gear...

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.790
To save Kei. To cause a resonance,

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.590
all the Regalia needed to
have someone bound to them.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:49.340
And that's why Abel came, too...

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:53.970
At that point, you and Rena--
Alecto had not been bound.

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:02.610
Yui... Take care of Ingrid for me.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.690
Ingrid... So, Abel was...

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:13.400
Yes. Abel fought to protect Kei and me--
Rena and you as well--from Johann.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.580
I sent a letter to the Empress once.

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:29.760
I told her that I was safe
and that Rena being in Enastoria

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:32.510
might cause trouble for you.

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.510
"If that is important to you,
then you should not hesitate

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.720
to see it through."

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:47.360
Yui and Rena are both family.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:56.700
It's okay. I know they'll work
together and figure things out.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:01.160
They're my daughters
and I'm proud of them.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:09.550
That letter was the one thing
that helped lift my spirits.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:11.300
I see...

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:18.590
I am truly sorry to have
involved you and this country.

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:22.180
I'm a little jealous.

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:23.100
Huh?

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:27.810
I never got to talk to my mom
about that kind of stuff.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:32.400
I'm sure there's a lot of things
she'd want to share with you.

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:37.160
I've been watching you fight for a long time.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.330
You've been lost, you've suffered...

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:46.460
...but you've never given up on
that which is important to you.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.590
Yuinshiel.

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:55.260
You're just like your dear mother.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.680
I can't take her place here...

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:05.850
But you have done so well.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:09.690
Thank you, Yuinshiel.

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.160
Quit crying, you guys!

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.780
Come on, you're crying too!

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:23.660
Ingrid... Please forgive me, I...

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.870
No need to be formal...

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:29.880
Okay, then you shouldn't be formal, either.

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:33.010
Sounds good, Yui.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:46.690
What are you two doing?
Dinner is getting cold!

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:48.980
Come on! Wipe those tears away, everyone!

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:55.780
Let's get going; our friends
are getting jealous.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.660
Huh? What's that?

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:04.120
This looks fun! I'd love to join you.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:09.000
Hey there! It's been a while.

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:11.420
Well, maybe not that long.

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:12.630
Johann!

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:21.590
How rude! Normally you'd let
someone speak a bit first...

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.720
Ahh, there's more of him!

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:28.230
We hardly ever see each other!

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:30.980
Why don't you be... a little more friendly?

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:32.190
What...?

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:36.570
Don't worry!

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.570
I'm not interested in you two anymore, Ingrid!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:42.490
I've found a new toy!

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:09.230
Wow, it's huge!

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:13.770
Pretty good, huh? I brought 'em
along to pick you guys up!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:14.820
Pick us up?

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.690
Where do you think you're taking us?

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:21.400
I wanted you all to have VIP
seats for the end of the world!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:42.260
Rena!

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.510
Yui, we're going with you.

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:49.220
We're going to stop him,
once and for all. All right, Kei?

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:50.230
Of course!

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:51.980
What about us, Sara?

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:54.940
Yui's home and city will be destroyed.
We're going, Tia!

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:56.150
Okay!

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:12.000
Here we go!

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:13.710
Yeah!

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.630
Sara... Tia...

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:18.380
Who's that?

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:19.500
Big sister?

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:20.380
Huh?

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:22.130
Yui!

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:23.970
Yui?

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:26.180
Yui... Yui!

00:20:26.390 --> 00:20:29.260
Oh, my! So she collapsed!

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:30.350
Huh?

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.730
What do you mean, "huh?"
Hadn't you noticed?

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:36.940
You and the Empress there
are in pretty bad shape.

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:40.530
Yui...

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:44.240
I don't believe it!
They've only just been bound!

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:48.950
True. But they took quite a lot.
You saw it, didn't you?

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:53.660
Yui!

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.840
N-No...

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:01.420
Yui!

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:06.130
The game is about to start.
I can't wait to see how she handles it.

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:20.730
What? No, no!

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:24.650
Ingrid!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.200
Johann!

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:30.910
Yes! Regalia of Erinius,
right this way, please!

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:45.550
Yui! Yui! Yui!

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:01.400
Rena...
